    "blocks": [
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "With Antora, you can create a component version’s navigation with AsciiDoc and store it alongside your source files."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "preamble",
        "id": null,
        "outline": null,
        "roles": [],
        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "The navigation for a site requires:"
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "ulist",
            "id": null,
            "items": [
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "at least one navigation file that contains at least one unordered AsciiDoc list,"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "at least one navigation file registered in the component version descriptor file, and"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "blocks": [],
                "checkbox": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "a UI bundle, such as Antora’s reference UI, that can apply styles and interaction behavior to the navigation menus Antora generates."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "style": null,
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "alt": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Antora navigation assembly diagram showing the required source files and the resulting menus where the content from the source files is displayed"
              }
            ],
            "attributes": {
              "width": "600"
            },
            "caption": null,
            "context": "image",
            "id": null,
            "roles": [],
            "src": "navigation-assembly.svg",
            "svg": null,
            "target": "navigation-assembly.svg",
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Let’s take a brief look at each of the numbered items in this diagram."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "The navigation for a component version is described by "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "at least one AsciiDoc file"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "files-and-lists.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ". You can think of this naviation file as a special AsciiDoc doctype. The file must only contain (or include) one or more unordered lists nested at any depth. As you can see in the diagram, you can assemble a component version’s navigation from multiple files. Creating a navigation file per module is a common organizational structure, but it isn’t required."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "A navigation file contains "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "one or more bulleted lists"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "files-and-lists.html#list-structure"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ". Each item in a list can be the cross reference to a page, URL to a website that isn’t part of the site, or unlinked text such as a category title that groups a nested set of list items. You can "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "compose the navigation from multiple files"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "include-lists.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "When you want the contents of a navigation file to be published to a component version’s page menu, you need to register the file in the corresponding component version descriptor file."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "navigation-files-source",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "one"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "18"
                },
                "id": null,
                "kind": "image",
                "roles": [
                  "conum",
                  "is-hidden-toc"
                ],
                "src": "one.svg",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "one.svg"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " Navigation files (Source)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Navigation files are "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "registered in a component version descriptor file"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "register-navigation-files.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " under the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "nav"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " key. List the navigation files in the order you want them to be displayed in the published component version page menu on your site. When Antora runs, it only uses the registered navigation files to create the component version page menu."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "navigation-registration-source",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "two"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "18"
                },
                "id": null,
                "kind": "image",
                "roles": [
                  "conum",
                  "is-hidden-toc"
                ],
                "src": "two.svg",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "two.svg"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " Navigation registration (Source)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Antora collects the contents of each registered navigation file, puts the contents in the order the files are listed under the "
                  },
                  {
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "nav"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "monospace",
                    "roles": []
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " key, and publishes a fully assembled menu of pages for the component version. The behavior and style of the component version page menu is dictated by the "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "UI bundle specified in your playbook"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "playbook:configure-ui.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Screenshot of the component version page menu in an Antora documentation site"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "660"
                },
                "caption": null,
                "context": "image",
                "id": null,
                "roles": [],
                "src": "component-navigation-menu.png",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "component-navigation-menu.png",
                "title": null
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "component-menu",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "three"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "18"
                },
                "id": null,
                "kind": "image",
                "roles": [
                  "conum",
                  "is-hidden-toc"
                ],
                "src": "three.svg",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "three.svg"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " Component version page menu (Site)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "When your site has several components or component versions, Antora assembles an aggregated list of the components and their versions. This menu of components and their component versions is the component version selector. Antora automatically lists the components in alphabetical order. (Refer to "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "sorting docs components"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "ROOT:how-component-versions-are-sorted.html#sort-docs-components"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " to learn how to change this order)."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Each component version is "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "ordered from the greatest to least"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "xref",
                    "target": "ROOT:how-component-versions-are-sorted.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ". If the latest component version of a component does not have any navigation defined, the component is hidden from this view."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Screenshot of the component version selector dropdown menu in an Antora documentation site"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "660"
                },
                "caption": null,
                "context": "image",
                "id": null,
                "roles": [],
                "src": "component-version-selector.png",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "component-version-selector.png",
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "In the reference UI, this list is displayed in the “drawer” located at the bottom of any component version page menu. When a visitor clicks on the drawer, it expands upwards and the reader can then select the component version they want to see."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "component-dropdown",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "four"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "18"
                },
                "id": null,
                "kind": "image",
                "roles": [
                  "conum",
                  "is-hidden-toc"
                ],
                "src": "four.svg",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "four.svg"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " Component version selector (Site)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "If a page is available in more than one version of a component, a dropdown selector is visible on that page in the reference UI. From this selector, a visitor can navigate between other versions of that page. Antora automatically populates this selector when multiple versions of a page are available."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Screenshot of the page version selector dropdown menu in an Antora documentation site"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "660"
                },
                "caption": null,
                "context": "image",
                "id": null,
                "roles": [],
                "src": "page-version-selector.png",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "page-version-selector.png",
                "title": null
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "page-dropdown",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "alt": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "five"
                  }
                ],
                "attributes": {
                  "width": "18"
                },
                "id": null,
                "kind": "image",
                "roles": [
                  "conum",
                  "is-hidden-toc"
                ],
                "src": "five.svg",
                "svg": null,
                "target": "five.svg"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " Page version selector (Site)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
